  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Financial Support to the European Union and Ministry for Communities and Returns (EU - MCR) Community Stabilization Programme Phase IV (EU-CSP IV)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of the European Union - Community Stabilization Programme (EU - CSP) Phase IV is to facilitate the creation of an inclusive multi-ethnic society in Kosovo (as per UNSC Resolution 1244 (1999)), through working to achieve socio-economic stability, community development initiatives, and viable income and employment creation with full access for all communities, ensuring their sustainable (re)integration, promotion of community stability and cohesion. The specific objective of the programme is to create income-generating opportunities for non-majority communities in key economic sectors in Kosovo, thereby enhancing their (re)integration prospects.</narrative>
  </description>
